WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:05.872
Bomber Arena is an old-school bomb-dropping maze battle, for two to four players.

2
00:00:06.572 --> 00:00:19.040
Move with the arrow keys or WASD, or the on-screen pad on a phone, and drop a bomb. After about two seconds, it explodes in a cross shape, and chain-reacts with any other bombs it touches.

3
00:00:19.191 --> 00:00:23.800
Blow up the brown crates to clear a path. Grey walls can't be destroyed.

4
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:29.889
Crates sometimes drop power-ups. Extra bombs, bigger blasts, and speed boots.

5
00:00:30.039 --> 00:00:33.051
Don't get caught in a blast, and that includes your own.

6
00:00:33.751 --> 00:00:41.784
Last player alive wins the round. And if it's taking too long, after seventy-five seconds, the walls start closing in.
